\addvspace {10\p@ }
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of system components developed or designed in order to assess the effect of interaction style on game enjoyment. These components will also be used in order to investigate whether game genre and previous gaming or touch-device experience impact the way in which interaction styles are perceived. The work allocation for the project is illustrated through the use of colour.\relax }}{3}{figure.caption.6}
