\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.7}{\ignorespaces Overview of game components and their relation to each other. The use of colour indicates the importance and scope of each component. Dark gray elements are responsible for coordinating a number of other components. Lighter gray items are responsible for the integration of a number of elements within a specific area, while the components in the lightest gray perform a single function and are not responsible for coordinating any of the other named items.\relax }}{25}{figure.caption.29}
